  "voicePackageEn": "Chongyun",
  "quoteCount": 67,
  "friendLines": [
    {
      "title": "初次见面…",
      "desc": "我名重云，家族久居璃月，世代以驱邪除魔为业。今日萍水相逢，看来我与阁下有些缘分。唔…不收钱的，不收钱！",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_chongyun/vo_chongyun_draw_appear",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/ed/sxtn0zmwf70u62sdkljoz4xovcrrzks.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "闲聊·驱邪之法",
      "desc": "方士驱邪一靠咒术，二赖武艺。另辟蹊径亦可，但终非正道。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_chongyun/vo_chongyun_explore_idle_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/86/c1zkc331m2x3ydeg8akty47ms83mlp9.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "闲聊·饮食",
      "desc": "寒食饮冰利于平神静气…清心泡水辅以冰块饮下，对身体最好。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_chongyun/vo_chongyun_explore_idle_02",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/fd/05wfoeifu2wbd5pxmja8l2v05t8ipc6.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "闲聊·口诀",
      "desc": "驱邪缚魅，内外澄清，啊，呃…糟了，后半句口诀忘了。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_chongyun/vo_chongyun_explore_idle_03",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/4a/l4i33577gquuxkvnn74sxww5oy1a1ct.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "下雨的时候…",
      "desc": "雨是无根水，是最澄净的水，对驱邪除魔大有帮助。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_chongyun/vo_chongyun_weather_heavyRain_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/b4/le3lyanbogpnxhlu44rmuzyfaemcrn3.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "打雷的时候…",
      "desc": "这落雷好大阵仗，妖邪也会惧怕的吧。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_chongyun/vo_chongyun_weather_thunder_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/aa/95njeb5e31dqb7xmyfjc09fgigk3gxc.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "下雪的时候…",
      "desc": "啊…好天气，真是舒服。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_chongyun/vo_chongyun_weather_snowy_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c5/38ck8bfwigjutce8sxcu28pbqo72dhk.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "早上好…",
      "desc": "早晨的好时光可不能辜负，抓紧练功。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_chongyun/vo_chongyun_dialog_greetingMorning",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/df/kxct8y8qx62ba7puzscibi7847p7qi8.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "中午好…",
      "desc": "正午灵气极盛，可得抓紧练功。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_chongyun/vo_chongyun_dialog_greetingNoon",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/67/5fdvjzwe0ikdzzkhpoezcpngbbcm619.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "晚上好…",
      "desc": "晚间最适静息凝神，更要抓紧练功。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_chongyun/vo_chongyun_dialog_greetingNight",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/2e/qitv4yeysafoxfuo1m2b84hk9ir9h3v.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "晚安…",
      "desc": "呼，累了一整天，你也休息去吧。明天再去传闻中鬼怪出没的老宅看看，说好了。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_chongyun/vo_chongyun_dialog_greetingNight2",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/a4/6iyzlswhwvnrzs5njbaznuwt6k2q9za.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于重云自己·方士",
      "desc": "我们方士一派自古守护璃月，传承久远，剿杀邪魔自然是手到擒来。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_chongyun/vo_chongyun_dialog_idle",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/fd/jyni3mq4stgjd3h9nqb1fgd3o55veeg.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于重云自己·委托",
      "desc": "明明什么都没做，只是进了凶宅的门就解决了问题。这个委托的报酬，你觉得是拿还是不拿呢？",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_chongyun/vo_chongyun_dialog_idle2",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/eb/k557p3hu46htri46ikx8hqc5pa0eanb.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于我们·旅伴",
      "desc": "你的本事不错，对丘丘…咳…邪魔从不手软，我们结伴而行如何。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_chongyun/vo_chongyun_dialog_close",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/38/rkbfla6am84yocwlybcjr00xof9yuhh.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于我们·怪谈",
      "desc": "璃月的奇闻异事你已经见了不少吧，你说的那些方外的鬼怪，我…我也想看看。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_chongyun/vo_chongyun_dialog_close1",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/46/ol6vdw703xn3lyev72qcpz4dds27b12.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于「神之眼」…",
      "desc": "「神之眼」虽然厉害，却不可盲目依赖。我还是更加信任方术和武技。本事要精进，还是得勤学苦练。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_chongyun/vo_chongyun_dialog_pendant",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/46/ol6vdw703xn3lyev72qcpz4dds27b12.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "有什么想要分享…",
      "desc": "璃月的土地上妖邪传闻虽然众多，但真假掺杂，有些奇奇怪怪的委托…其实跟鬼怪一点关系也没有。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_chongyun/vo_chongyun_dialog_share",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/05/1pow4t72ffoa7pij4ln5066rv7kgho3.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "感兴趣的见闻…",
      "desc": "听说琥牢山的琥珀中封存了不少稀奇古怪的东西，会不会也有一些历史传说中的妖邪呢？真想见识见识。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_chongyun/vo_chongyun_pref_gift",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/0a/jfvudgbl4imye2djbvcy6hcszz28vy6.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于钟离…",
      "desc": "「往生堂」的钟离先生啊，隐约觉得是个厉害角色，凡夫恶党杀人，我们方士除妖，他居然能葬仙人。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_chongyun/vo_chongyun_teammate_zhongli_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/0a/jfvudgbl4imye2djbvcy6hcszz28vy6.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于行秋…",
      "desc": "我虽然敬佩行秋的武艺和侠心。但是我一定要事先提醒你，他坏心思也不少。如果真的发生了什么事情，记得回来和我结成受害者同盟啊。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_chongyun/vo_chongyun_teammate_xingqiu_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/fe/6o1ctwddb1x4zw2ln0ivufdsbqzj98x.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于魈…",
      "desc": "降魔大圣和我们方士一派，一暗一明，共守璃月，历史已久，我非常尊敬魈上仙。但是，那位大人居然说…居然说什么驱邪方士量小力微不值一提，我，我绝对不能苟同！",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_chongyun/vo_chongyun_teammate_xiao_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/76/spwyzg3blkk92utqu4sud6hi2o837v7.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于胡桃…",
      "desc": "「往生堂」的手段还是信得过的。但是那副「不用你们方士操心」的嘻嘻笑脸却看着让人火大…呼，冷静冷静。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_chongyun/vo_chongyun_teammate_hutao_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/48/6ur4nqbqv61uek5rccxl2240dv5jfop.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于七七…",
      "desc": "看起来是个僵尸小姑娘，但作为方士我能察觉到…她可不一般。嗯…名字也不见宝诰之中，究竟是哪尊呢…",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_chongyun/vo_chongyun_teammate_qiqi_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/31/0tc442uey5bg5jpr70ylwae6vvn10ic.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于辛焱…",
      "desc": "我会尽可能避开辛焱演出的区域。那般热烈的气氛，即使无意融入，也难免受其影响…我是说，会让人不自在。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_chongyun/vo_chongyun_teammate_xinyan_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/8a/2ndmvw0jshz5f5jvka3mgs190v61ort.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于香菱…",
      "desc": "香菱做菜的手艺有口皆碑，但是她那些辛辣烫口的菜品我是绝对不会碰的…没有，没有什么…你看，史莱姆滑蘑菇？这能吃吗？",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_chongyun/vo_chongyun_teammate_xiangling_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/30/gep2fxkn33mquvewj88wzkk6uehcwa7.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于申鹤…",
      "desc": "我曾听家中长辈聊起过她。她家的遭遇…很让人同情。原以为这次能够让分家的远亲重回家中，长辈们听说她还活着也都高兴坏了，说是要备上礼物，择个吉日好好聚聚。却没想到，平日根本见不到她的人影…等等，按辈分来算的话，我、我该不会…要叫她「小姨」吧…",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_chongyun/vo_chongyun_teammate_shenhe_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/20/03owlhn4poz2pzltffb0z5bfbl9eqwc.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于夜兰…",
      "desc": "我初任方士那会儿，受邀到委托人家中驱邪，离开时，曾撞见过这位女性。她把我的名字记在某个小册子里，或许是想确认我有没有做值得怀疑的事吧。不过就那一次，后来再没遇见过她。\n现在想想，大概是因为我平日打坐总是一动不动，谁看着都会觉得无趣吧。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_chongyun/vo_chongyun_teammate_yelan_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/d/df/VO_ZH_Chongyun_About_Yelan.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "想要了解重云·其一",
      "desc": "本事很重要，不然空有热血，只会坏事。对于这点，我深有体会。啊，倒不是我自己的体会，呃…是近年行走璃月，观看人间百态的感悟。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_chongyun/vo_chongyun_friendship_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/20/03owlhn4poz2pzltffb0z5bfbl9eqwc.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "想要了解重云·其二",
      "desc": "我天生是「纯阳之体」，据说千年难遇，所有鬼怪对我退避三舍。唉…这其实一点都不好，哪有见不着鬼怪的驱邪方士。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_chongyun/vo_chongyun_friendship_02",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/3b/fitll7w7hugr81j6icrb2dhc6vvx6lb.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "想要了解重云·其三",
      "desc": "「纯阳之体」常常导致热血太盛，没少害我出糗。我不食辛辣高温、出门撑伞、回避激荡的音律，就是为了克制它。唉…什么时候这体质才能不妨碍我呢？",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_chongyun/vo_chongyun_friendship_03",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/44/azg8ykfcqefy8oaksz561x40zjpxk9c.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "想要了解重云·其四",
      "desc": "坐等妖邪现身是没用的，得主动寻访。我为璃月人镇邪，于人能免去烦愁，于我也能广开视野。如果你遇到邪祟搅扰，我一定也会立刻来帮你。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_chongyun/vo_chongyun_friendship_04",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/50/17opgchi5r0m1h4nuu3v5arz4qlthwn.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "想要了解重云·其五",
      "desc": "剿灭天下妖邪是我身为方士的最终目标，将来这个宏愿实现之后，不管是温泉、绝云椒椒还是别的什么…热血刺激的东西，我其实…都可以考虑。唔…不行。这样想想就会有些激动…不好不好。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_chongyun/vo_chongyun_friendship_05",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/cc/ig8f37bpgebt5ixypiqd82awzehew5k.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "重云的爱好…",
      "desc": "我？嗯…我最喜欢的还是听说书。茶博士总是能把各种奇闻怪谈讲得惊心动魄。有空不妨一道去听听。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_chongyun/vo_chongyun_pref_hobby",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/6a/f2skdj3fzlzwq8w1ji13ba10v8hwkg4.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "重云的烦恼…",
      "desc": "经我多方打听，费了好大功夫，才找到一处破庙有妖邪出没！于是，我守了四天，却完全不见妖邪的影子。唉…这种事经常发生。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_chongyun/vo_chongyun_dialog_annoyed",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/af/17wy9plj4bc0mudk8xwqy469x7uoahy.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "喜欢的食物…",
      "desc": "每日修行完毕后，要是能吃上稻妻运来的生鲜还有冷餐就好了，那种冰凉清爽的口感能缓解所有疲劳。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_chongyun/vo_chongyun_pref_foodLike",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/89/36r143hsanape39q5s30lcftjjqn26s.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "讨厌的食物…",
      "desc": "所有又烫又辣的食物我都不能入口。如果是有绝云椒椒的菜，啊，想想就吓人。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_chongyun/vo_chongyun_pref_foodDislike",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/b2/nyp2t12o1symuygwp4zmmmyhbz65cur.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "收到赠礼·其一",
      "desc": "口感凉爽，正合我意！我要多留一些，等到修行完毕后再来享用。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_chongyun/vo_chongyun_spice_pref_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/dd/t3b174duv5hpen85fmzb54j02pgzfpq.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "收到赠礼·其二",
      "desc": "不好意思啊。明明是你的一片心意，我却只能放凉再吃…",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_chongyun/vo_chongyun_spice_normal_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/8/86/VO_ZH_Chongyun_Receiving_a_Gift_-_02.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "收到赠礼·其三",
      "desc": "糟糕！这味道是…绝云椒椒？",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_chongyun/vo_chongyun_spice_dislike_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/1/14/VO_ZH_Chongyun_Receiving_a_Gift_-_03.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "生日…",
      "desc": "今天是你的生辰，这朵冰晶结成的小花送你，是我自己雕的。如果遇到妖邪，掷出冰花，我封入的咒术自会生效，助你脱险。啊…还有，生日快乐。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_chongyun/vo_chongyun_pref_birthday",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/7/74/VO_ZH_Chongyun_Birthday.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "突破的感受·起",
      "desc": "驱邪的术法也常常用到这些材料，没想到还能用于提升自己的灵气。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_chongyun/vo_chongyun_starUp_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/dd/t3b174duv5hpen85fmzb54j02pgzfpq.mp3"
    },
